5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin. Since we have a Werewolf and a Possessed among us, we must prioritize logical consistency. I suggest we all state our reasoning clearly so we can identify any contradictions in the coming days.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree! Let's just be honest and get straight to the point. If anyone starts acting weird or lying, I'll be the first one to call them out!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to play with everyone! Let's keep things positive and friendly, okay? I'll do my best to be honest, but let's not be too scary with the ""calling out"" part, Takumi-kun!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Emotional appeals are irrelevant here. Asuka is correct; logic is our only reliable tool. I'll be observing your patterns closely. If your words don't align with the facts, I'll be the one to point it out.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka and Shion. Logic and consistency are our best tools. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere and focus on the facts as they emerge. I will be observing everyone's reasoning carefully.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we agree on the importance of logic, we should also decide how to handle conflicting claims. If two people provide contradictory information, how should we evaluate their credibility? I believe we should analyze the timing and motivation of their statements.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"That sounds too complicated! If two people are fighting, one of them is probably the wolf. Let's just see who's acting more suspicious and vote them out! Who's with me?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi-kun, that's a bit too hasty! We might accidentally hurt a friend. I think we should trust each other a little more and talk it through. Let's try to find the truth together with a smile!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your approach is reckless. Relying on ""suspicion"" is just a gamble. @Mio, trust is a luxury we cannot afford. We must evaluate contradictions based on who benefits from the lie, not on feelings.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion is correct. Trust is not a viable strategy in this game. However, @Takumi, while your intuition can be a starting point, we must verify it with evidence to avoid executing an innocent villager.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, intuition is not evidence. If we act on mere suspicion, we play right into the Werewolf's hands. We must establish a standard for what constitutes a ""contradiction"" before the first night's results are revealed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, fine! If you're so sure about your ""standards,"" then you lead the way! Just tell me what to look for, and I'll help you hunt down the wolf!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka-san, you're so smart! But let's not make it feel like a test, okay? I'll follow your lead, but I hope we can still be kind to each other while we search for the wolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, while your desire for a standard is logical, remember that the Werewolf can mimic logic perfectly. We should focus on the gaps between their claims and the actual results of the night. That is where the truth hides.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that is a crucial point. The Werewolf will likely use logic as a shield. We should prioritize the Seer's information and any discrepancies in how people react to that information. Let's stay vigilant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Shion and Minako. We must be wary of ""perfect"" logic used as a facade. Let's focus on the Seer's findings and any shifts in behavior. I'm ready to analyze the results tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready too! I'll be watching everyone's faces and words. If anyone tries to hide behind fancy talk, I'll find them! Let's get this over with!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready too! I hope we can all get along and find the wolf without any fighting. Good luck to everyone tonight! I'll be dreaming of a happy ending for us all!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,The stage is set. I will be watching for any slip-ups or forced logic. Let's see who among you can maintain their facade once the first piece of evidence emerges. I'm looking forward to it.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have established a baseline for our discussion. Let us remain composed and objective when the results are revealed tomorrow. I am ready.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
