36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night has passed. If the Seer has obtained a result, I suggest they consider how to present it. Should we expect a claim, or will the Seer remain hidden to avoid being targeted?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, just come out and say it! If the Seer knows who the wolf is, why hide? Let's just get the info and kick the wolf out right now! Who's the wolf? Speak up!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi-kun, you're always so impatient! Let's give the Seer some time to think. If they come out too early, the wolf might target them next, and that would be so sad! Right, everyone?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your impatience is a liability. A Seer who reveals themselves too early is simply providing the Werewolf with a target list. We must weigh the value of the information against the risk of losing the Seer.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion is right. A premature reveal could be fatal for the Seer. However, we do need a plan to utilize the information. Seer, please share your findings only if you believe the benefit outweighs the risk.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, your demand for an immediate reveal is counterproductive. If the Seer is forced out and then killed tonight, we lose our only source of objective truth. We should wait for a voluntary claim or a logical necessity.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, you're always talking about ""risks"" and ""necessities""! It's just making this take forever! If we're too scared to act, the wolf just wins! I'm tired of waiting—someone just tell us what happened!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi-kun, you're getting way too grumpy! It's just a game, let's not get all stressed out. If we just push and push, the Seer might get scared and stay quiet! Let's just be patient and friendly, okay?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your frustration is predictable, but it's also a convenient smoke screen. Are you truly impatient, or are you trying to force a reveal to identify the Seer for your own benefit? Your aggression is becoming a data point.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that is a valid observation. @Takumi, while your enthusiasm is clear, your insistence on an immediate reveal is indeed suspicious. Please explain why you are so eager to expose the Seer right now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, @Shion and @Minako have raised a critical point. Your insistence on an immediate reveal is logically flawed and strategically risky. Are you attempting to flush out the Seer to protect the Werewolf? Please provide a logical justification for your urgency.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, @Shion, @Minako! Stop treating me like a criminal! I'm just trying to win! Why is it ""suspicious"" to want the truth? I'm not protecting anyone; I just hate wasting time! Is that a crime?!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi-kun, please don't be so upset! I'm sure you just want us to win. Everyone is just being extra careful because they care about the game. Let's all take a deep breath and be nice!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your emotional outbursts are a poor substitute for logic. You claim to hate wasting time, yet you're wasting it by reacting defensively. If you're a villager, your behavior is merely foolish; if not, it's a desperate attempt to deflect.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, reacting emotionally does not provide the justification we asked for. While you may simply be impulsive, your behavior is currently the most disruptive element in our search for the truth. We need a calm explanation, not an outburst.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, your inability to provide a logical justification, coupled with your defensive reactions, makes you a primary suspect. Unless someone else has information, your behavior is the only concrete anomaly we have. I propose we consider voting for you.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, that's totally unfair! I'm just being me! You're all just ganging up on me because I'm not talking like a textbook! I'm a villager, I swear! Don't let the wolf trick you into killing me!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka-san, @Takumi-kun, wait! Let's not be so mean! Voting someone out just because they're loud feels wrong. What if we're making a huge mistake? I can't bear the thought of us hurting a friend! Let's think again!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your sentimentality is a blind spot. @Takumi, your ""personality"" is not a valid defense against logical suspicion. Since you've provided no reasoning, you are the most efficient target. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, I understand your concern, but we must prioritize the village's survival over sentiment. @Takumi, your lack of logical grounding makes it difficult to trust your intentions. I agree with the current consensus. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
