69,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Takumi has been executed, and Shion was attacked. This confirms the Werewolf viewed Shion as a threat or a high-value target. Since Takumi is gone, we must now re-evaluate the remaining players. Seer, do you have new information?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no, Shion-kun is gone! That's just terrible! I can't believe the wolf would do something so mean. @Asuka-san, do you think the Seer knows something now? I'm really scared, but I want us to find the wolf!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the fact that Shion was targeted suggests the Werewolf feared Shion's analytical approach. With two players gone, the margin for error is now slim. Seer, if you have a result, now is the time to speak.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, fear is not helpful. @Minako, I agree. With only three of us left, the Werewolf only needs one more kill or a tie in voting to win. Seer, if you are among us, your silence now is a risk we cannot afford.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka-san, you're right, it's getting really scary! I'm shaking just thinking about it. But if the Seer is too afraid to speak, maybe we can help them feel safe? Please, if you know anything, tell us! I trust you guys!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, your trust is appreciated, but we must rely on evidence. @Asuka, if the Seer remains silent, we are essentially guessing. If neither of you is the Seer, then the Seer must have been Takumi or Shion, meaning we have no more divinations.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, that is a critical point. If neither Mio nor I is the Seer, we are blind. @Mio, please be honest: are you the Seer? If you are not, and I am not, we must assume the Seer is dead and rely solely on behavioral analysis.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka-san, I'm not the Seer! I wish I were, because then I could just tell you who the mean wolf is and we could all be happy again! I'm just a regular villager who's really worried about us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, thank you for your honesty. If @Asuka is also not the Seer, then the Seer is indeed dead. This means we must rely on our own observations. @Asuka, what is your role? If you are a villager, we are in a very precarious position.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am a Villager. Since Mio also claims to be a Villager, the only remaining possibility for the Werewolf and the Possessed is between us and Minako. @Minako, please state your role and your reasoning for our next move.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Minako-san, please tell us! I'm so nervous... if we're all just villagers, then where is the wolf hiding? I really hope we can figure this out together so no one else gets hurt!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Minako,,"I am a Villager. Since we have all claimed to be humans, one of us is lying. @Asuka, you have been the most assertive. If you are the wolf, you are using logic to manipulate us. I believe we should analyze who benefits most from the current situation.","{""words"":48,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
